                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND SYSTEM FÜR LEBERGRENZIDENTIFIKATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET SYSTÈME D'IDENTIFICATION DE DÉLIMITATION DU FOIE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LIVER BOUNDARY IDENTIFICATION METHOD, AND SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to the technical field of medical image processing, and relates in particular to a liver boundary identification method, and a system. The method comprises: obtaining liver tissue information of a liver tissue to be identified; using image processing technology or signal processing technology to identify a liver tissue boundary within the liver tissue information according to a feature of the liver tissue corresponding to the liver tissue information and a liver tissue boundary feature; outputting position information of the identified liver tissue boundary. Via the present method, the boundary of the liver tissue is automatically identified, the identification efficiency of the liver boundary is increased, and automatic positioning of the liver boundary is thereby implemented.</p>
            </abstract>
